revytech-license activates a product key against the pkg origin and writes a
0600 pkg overlay with per-repo HTTP_AUTH. It works for every series (CloudBSD
and REVYTECH). Base OS images still install /etc/pkg/CloudBSD.conf from
cloudbsd-src; this port ships samples under PREFIX/etc/pkg.

WWW: https://github.com/revytechinc/pkg-repo
